<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-CANNES DISMISS COACH LACOMBE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CANNES DISMISS COACH LACOMBE.</headline>
<dateline>CANNES, France 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French first division club Cannes dismissed coach Guy Lacombe on Tuesday because of poor results.</p>
<p>Lacombe took over in October 1995.</p>
<p>Cannes finished 15th in the French league which ended on Saturday.</p>
<p>His successsor has yet to be named, the club said.</p>
</text>
